---
/**
 * Light-theme code block with manual syntax highlighting.
 * Inner HTML uses span classes: .kw, .ty, .fn, .str, .num, .cm, .op, .builtin
 * Also supports legacy classes: .keyword, .string, .number, .comment, .type
 */
---

<div class="code-block px-5 py-4 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <slot />
</div>
